</name><name><surname>Chrousos</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effectiveness of prolonged glucocorticoid treatment in acute respiratory distress syndrome: the right drug, the right way?</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>236</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16374183</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b92-cln63_1p0109"><label>92</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vincent</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernard</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>Beale</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Doig</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Putensen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Dhainaut</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Drotrecogin alfa (activated) treatment in severe sepsis from the global open-label trial ENHANCE: further evidence for survival and safety and implications for early treatment</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>2266</fpage><lpage>77</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16215381</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b93-cln63_1p0109"><label>93</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abraham</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Laterre</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name><name><surname>Garg</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Talwar</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Trzaskoma</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Drotrecogin alfa (activated) for adults with severe sepsis and a low risk of death</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>353</volume><fpage>1332</fpage><lpage>41</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16192478</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b94-cln63_1p0109"><label>94</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Amato</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbas</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Medeiros</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Magaldi</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Schettino</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name><name><surname>Lorenzi-Filho</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effect of a protective-ventilation strategy on mortality in the acute respiratory distress syndrome</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>338</volume><fpage>347</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9449727</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b95-cln63_1p0109"><label>95</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Meade</surname><given-names>MO</given-names></name><name><surname>Cook</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Granton</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><name><surname>Hodder</surname><given-names>RV</given-names></name><name><surname>Lapinsky</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Evaluation of a ventilation strategy to prevent barotrauma in patients at high risk for acute respiratory distress syndrome. Pressure-and Volume-Limited Ventilation Strategy Group</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>338</volume><fpage>355</fpage><lpage>61</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9449728</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b96-cln63_1p0109"><label>96</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-ty